# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF on every platform. The immutable
# script store (engine/cb_scripts.py) verifies each script by SHA-256; a CRLF checkout on Windows
# changed the bytes and failed every script (found 2026-09-02, the first Windows start).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.bundle binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
